   221                              <1> findDelimiter:
   222                              <1> ;Goes to the next delimiter.
   223                              <1> ;Input: rsi must point to the start of the data string
   224                              <1> ;       ecx = Number of chars left to to process
   225                              <1> ;Output: rsi points to the first non-delimiter char
   226                              <1> ;       ecx = Chars left to process after skipping
