   462                              <1> switchAdjustBpb:
   463                              <1> ;Intervenes if /F or {/N /T} are set only on removable devices.
   464                              <1> ;Can only be called AFTER we get the current BPB from the driver.
   465                              <1> ;Needed for 
   466 00000E4B F605A30100003E      <1>     test byte [bFlag1], bitSec | bitTrk | bitFloppy
   467                              <1>     retz    ;No bits set, return
    41                              <2> cret z
